  "solution": {
    "text": "$f \\propto v \\propto \\sqrt{T}$\nFurther $\\Sigma \\tau_p=0$\nor\nor\n$$\nf_{A B}=2 f_{C D} \\Rightarrow T_{A B}=4 T_{C D}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_{A B}(x) & =T_{C D}(l-x) \\\\\n4 x & =l-x\\left(\\text { as } T_{A B}-4 T_{C D}\\right) \\\\\nx & =\\frac{l}{5}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
